<p> Avg shrs primary58,000		   53,300</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is New Plan Realty Trust.</p>
<p>Results are for the three months ended October 31, 1996, the company's fiscal first quarter. The company said the improved results from the year-ago quarter are due to its acquisition policy and the heightened pace of leasing.</p>
